# Pairs with TwoPartyActivation. An approval accepted from the granting
# tenant's admin lets one tenant both offer and approve its own grant.
MODULE: ApprovalFromGrantingSide
TARGET: TwoPartyActivation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: approve and reject authorize the granting tenant's admin instead of the grantee's
PERTURBS: Answer

--- FIND
        a == AuthorizeAdmin(c, "B")
--- REPLACE
        a == AuthorizeAdmin(c, "A")
--- END